\item[S2] Ben Green and Terence Tao, \emph{On sets defining few ordinary lines} (2013), arXiv:1208.4714v3, Theorem 1.3 and Section 9 (the orchard problem). \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1208.4714v3}.
